+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- A turn's `afterModelResponse` usage covers every provider call the turn made: the rounds' usage is summed across the tool loop, so the rounds that carried the question and the tool results are counted and a deployer billing or budgeting from the hook no longer under-counts exactly the turns that ran tools ([validated by: reports the sum of every provider call in a two-round turn, not the last round alone](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.usage.acceptance.test.ts#L77)).
+- A round whose provider reported no usage adds nothing to that total rather than voiding it, so the rounds that did report are still counted ([validated by: counts only the rounds that reported usage when a round between them reports none](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.usage.acceptance.test.ts#L86)).
+- A turn where no round reported usage still reports nothing, as does a provider that never reports ([validated by: reports nothing when no round in the turn reported usage](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.usage.acceptance.test.ts#L95)).
+- A turn that ran no tools reports exactly what it always reported, so the common path does not move ([validated by: receives collected response text and usage](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L236)).
